sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as REST/gRPC API
    participant VOS as VectorOperationsService
    participant CS as CollectionService
    participant SE as StorageEngine
    participant WAL as WriteAheadLog
    participant Memtable
    participant Index
    participant Cache as CacheOrchestrator
    participant Metrics

    Client->>API: POST /collections/{id}/vectors
    API->>API: Validate Request
    API->>VOS: insert_vectors(collection_id, vectors)
    
    VOS->>CS: get_collection(collection_id)
    CS-->>VOS: Collection metadata
    
    VOS->>VOS: Check compression config
    VOS->>VOS: Validate vector dimensions
    
    VOS->>SE: get_engine(collection_id)
    SE-->>VOS: StorageEngine instance
    
    par Parallel Operations
        VOS->>WAL: append(vectors)
        WAL->>WAL: Serialize to proto
        WAL->>WAL: Write to log
        WAL-->>VOS: WAL position
    and
        VOS->>Memtable: insert(vectors)
        Memtable->>Memtable: Store in memory
        Memtable-->>VOS: Success
    and
        VOS->>Index: add_vectors(vectors)
        Index->>Index: Update index structure
        Index-->>VOS: Index updated
    end
    
    VOS->>Cache: invalidate_related(vector_ids)
    Cache->>Cache: Cascade invalidation
    Cache-->>VOS: Cache cleared
    
    VOS->>Metrics: record_insert(count, latency)
    Metrics-->>VOS: Recorded
    
    alt Flush Threshold Reached
        Memtable->>SE: trigger_flush()
        SE->>SE: Create SSTable/Parquet
        SE->>SE: Apply compression
        SE->>SE: Write to disk
        SE-->>Memtable: Flush complete
        Memtable->>Memtable: Clear flushed data
    end
    
    VOS-->>API: InsertResponse
    API-->>Client: 200 OK {success: true, count: n}

    Note over WAL,Memtable: Write-Ahead Log ensures durability
    Note over Index: Index updates are asynchronous
    Note over SE: Storage engine handles compression